<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka Sampath up on foreign buying.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka Sampath up on foreign buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sampath Bank Ltd rose 3.9 prcent or three rupees to 80, on foreign buying on Thursday, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There is foreign buying interest in the share and brokers are looking for substantial volumes of the stocks,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Blue chip Sampath Bank is one of four private commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
